# Silver Sable, Mercenary Leader: "When Silver Sable enters, put a +1/+1 counter on another target creature" (not herself, CR 115.1) and
# "Whenever Silver Sable attacks, target modified creature you control gains lifelink until end of turn." A creature with a counter is
# modified (CR 700.9). Bot1 has two Ornithopters; the counter goes on #1. When Sable attacks on turn 3 the only modified creature Bot1 controls is
# that one (Sable herself, with no counter, and the other Ornithopter are not), so it is the one target and gains lifelink.

[Bot1 Deck]
Silver Sable, Mercenary Leader
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
